at":"2014-05-02T13:41:57Z","updated_at":"2014-05-02T13:41:57Z","body":"It's difficult to extract code from application but scenario is simple. When you try to use var_export on  object with circular reference var_export crashes. \nWhen I stored such object in session getContextMessage is finished with console message \n\n```\nUncaught exception 'yii\\base\\ErrorException' with message 'var_export does not handle circular references' in /home/jarek/Projekty/dentax/app/dentomax/vendor/yiisoft/yii2/log/Target.php:118\nStack trace:\n```\n\nwhen I temporary fixed this to code \n\n```\nprotected function getContextMessage()\n    {\n        $context = [];\n        foreach ($this->logVars as $name) {\n            if (!empty($GLOBALS[$name])) {\n               //$context[] = \"\\${$name} = \" . var_export($GLOBALS[$name], true);\n               $context[] = \"\\${$name} = \" . \\yii\\helpers\\VarDumper::dumpAsString($GLOBALS[$name]);\n\n            }\n        }\n        return implode(\"\\n\\n\", $context);\n    }\n```\n\nIt works fine.\nTo give more overview it happend when I changed application language and message file was missing.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/42032935/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jarekkozak","id":5037528,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzc1Mjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5037528?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jarekkozak","html_url":"https://github.com/jarekkozak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jarekkozak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jarekkozak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jarekkozak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jarekkozak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://ap